{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18399","headline":"赋得春风扇微和 · 豆卢荣","name":"赋得春风扇微和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春晴生缥缈，软吹和初徧。\n池影动渊沦，山容发葱蒨。\n迟迟入绮阁，习习流芳甸。\n树杪扬莺啼，阶前落花片。\n韶光恐闲放，旭日宜游宴。\n文客拂尘衣，仁风愿回扇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"豆卢荣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18399.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18399","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}